(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF FINANCE - DEPARTMENT OF FINANCIAL SERVICES) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: PRADHAN MANTRI MUDRA YOJANA - SHISHU \(PMMY-SHISHU\) / MUDRA / COMMERCIAL BANKS, RRBS, SMALL FINANCE BANKS, MFIS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Micro-finance credit facility providing loans up to Rs. 50,000 for early-stage) Tj
T*
(or very small micro-enterprises with minimal paperwork and zero collateral.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Any Indian citizen who has a business plan for non-farm income-) Tj
T*
(   generating activity such as manufacturing, processing, trading, or) Tj
T*
(   service sector.) Tj
T*
(2. Loan requirement is up to Rs. 50,000.) Tj
T*
(3. No collateral required.) Tj
T*
(4. Applicant must not be a defaulter to any bank or financial institution.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Loans up to Rs. 50,000 at competitive bank interest rates, nil processing) Tj
T*
(   fee, and zero collateral security.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 0.5 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Identity Proof \(Voter ID / Aadhaar / PAN / Driving License\)) Tj
T*
(2. Address Proof) Tj
T*
(3. Passport size photographs) Tj
T*
(4. Quotation of machinery/items to be purchased or business outline) Tj
T*
(5. Bank Account Statement \(if available\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online via Udyamimitra / Jan Samarth Portal or any Bank Branch) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://www.mudra.org.in/) Tj
T*
